EXPLEO – DevOps / Cloud Interview Experience (Real Questions)

Sharing a real interview question set asked at XPLEO, useful for DevOps, Cloud Engineer & FinOps-focused roles 👇

⸻

🔹 Introduction & FinOps

1️⃣ Give your self-introduction
2️⃣ What are the principles of FinOps?
3️⃣ How do you segregate cost in a multi-cloud environment?
4️⃣ How do you present cloud cost to higher management?
5️⃣ If you see a sudden spike in cloud cost, how do you investigate and optimize it?
6️⃣ What are the key risk indicators to identify budget overruns?

⸻

🔹 GCP Cost & Monitoring

7️⃣ How do you set budget alerts in GCP?
8️⃣ How do you optimize GCP resources for cost control?

⸻

🔹 CI/CD & Security

9️⃣ How do you create connectivity between CI/CD pipelines and GCP?
🔟 How do you store and manage secrets securely?
1️⃣1️⃣ How do you reduce CI/CD pipeline execution time?

⸻

🔹 Migration & Operations

1️⃣2️⃣ How do you migrate on-prem workloads to GCP?
1️⃣3️⃣ If a VM instance is continuously starting and stopping, how do you troubleshoot and fix it?

⸻

🔹 GCP Core Concepts

1️⃣4️⃣ What are the different types of IAM roles in GCP?
1️⃣5️⃣ What are the different types of compute instances in GCP?
1️⃣6️⃣ Why are lifecycle policies important?
1️⃣7️⃣ Why do we use BigQuery?
1️⃣8️⃣ Why do we use Cloud Functions? What are its limitations?

⸻

🔹 Data & Kubernetes

1️⃣9️⃣ Which tools would you use for data automation / data CI/CD pipelines?
2️⃣0️⃣ Explain the components of Kubernetes
2️⃣1️⃣ Explain the components of VPC in GCP

⸻

🔹 Scenario-Based & Decision Making

2️⃣2️⃣ A developer asks to buy a premium tier service — how do you evaluate and respond?
2️⃣3️⃣ What does 90% code quality / test coverage actually mean?

⸻

💡 Interview Tip:
They’re not just checking tool knowledge — they’re checking:
	•	Cost awareness (FinOps mindset)
	•	Decision-making skills
	•	Real-world troubleshooting
	•	Communication with management

If you can explain WHY + HOW, you’re already ahead 🚀
